description.desc:
While Robin is in the [Off-Field Guard] state, this skill triggers automatically when another active character in the squad lands any attack on an enemy:
Swings her staff to attack forward, dealing <color=#FE437E>Ether DMG</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill;
Upon activation, gains 20 [Entry Points] and grants all squad members a [Robin Shield] equal to 3% of Robin's initial Max HP, lasting 15s;
[Special Attack: Aftershock] counts as an Aftershock and can be triggered at most once every 8s.

When activating [Special Attack: Aftershock], if Energy is at least 40, it is upgraded to [EX Special Attack: Enhanced Aftershock]:
Continuously consumes a total of 40 Energy to fire a powerful laser forward, dealing massive <color=#FE437E>Ether DMG</color>;
Robin's heavy attacks deal additional DMG equal to <color=#2BAD00>{CAL:0.214+AvatarSkillLevel(1)*0.028,100,2}%</color> of her Max HP;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill;
Upon activation, gains 20 [Entry Points] and grants all squad members a [Robin Shield] equal to 6% of her initial Max HP, lasting 15s;
[EX Special Attack: Enhanced Aftershock] counts as an Aftershock.

After using a <color=#FFFFFF>Counter Assist</color>, press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate [Assist Follow-Up], which automatically triggers:
Deals massive <color=#FE437E>Ether DMG</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

desc:
When Robin uses certain skills, she grants all squad members a shield [Robin Shield] based on a varying percentage of Robin's initial Max HP, lasting 15s. When a character gains [Robin Shield] again, the shield value stacks and the duration of [Robin Shield] is extended, up to a maximum of 60s. The shield value cannot exceed 8% of Robin's initial Max HP;
Each time a squad member gains [Robin Shield], their DMG increases by <color=#2BAD00>12.5%</color> for 15s. Repeated triggers refresh the duration;
Using [Special Attack: Step Up] triggers a Quick Assist. After switching out, Robin enters the [Off-Field Guard] state for 60s. While in the [Off-Field Guard] state, Robin's Aftershocks grant [Entry Points], up to a maximum of 120;
When [Entry Points] are at 100 or above, Robin can be actively switched in via [Entry Skill]. Switching in automatically consumes 100 [Entry Points] to activate [Entry Skill] and ends the [Off-Field Guard] state;
When activating [Entry Skill], Robin gains 1 [Buff Enhance Point], up to a maximum of 1;
When entering the [Off-Field Guard] state, if Robin has a [Buff Enhance Point], 1 [Buff Enhance Point] is consumed to further increase the DEF boost provided by the [Off-Field Guard] state and its cap by 25%;
Each time a squad member triggers Maim, Robin restores 15 Energy.

When Robin uses certain skills, she grants all squad members a [Robin Shield] scaling off varying percentages of Robin's initial Max HP, lasting 15s. Gaining [Robin Shield] again stacks the shield amount and extends its duration, up to a maximum of 60s. The total shield amount cannot exceed 8% of Robin's initial Max HP;
Each time a squad member gains [Robin Shield], their DMG dealt increases by <color=#2BAD00>18.8%</color> for 15s. Repeated triggers refresh the duration;
Using [Special Attack: Step Up] triggers a Quick Assist. After switching out, Robin enters the [Off-Field Guard] state for 60s. While in [Off-Field Guard], Robin gains [Entry Points] when she uses an Aftershock, up to a maximum of 120 points;
When Robin has 100 or more [Entry Points], she can be actively switched in via her [Entry Skill]. Upon switching in, 100 [Entry Points] are automatically consumed to activate her [Entry Skill], and she exits the [Off-Field Guard] state;
When Robin activates her [Entry Skill], she gains 1 [Buff Enhance Point], up to a maximum of 1;
Upon entering the [Off-Field Guard] state, if Robin has a [Buff Enhance Point], 1 [Buff Enhance Point] is consumed to further increase the DEF boost granted by [Off-Field Guard] and its cap by 25%;
Each time a squad member triggers a Maim, Robin restores 15 Energy.
